add(343,'Make authorized detached stop reachable','The registered detached lifecycle MUST admit cancellation of a launched invocation when the host-bound caller holds the exact control grant and the producer confirms lifecycle ownership.','C033 C042','P2 reproduced host cancel-grant denial and production ownership wiring is absent on the detection surface in C033; fully permissioned helper-host cancellation works (C042), not registered cancellation.', ['Assert a registered launch followed by an authorized workflow_control cancel issues exactly one native cancel and readback records its terminal outcome.','Assert observe-only, missing control grant, foreign scope and mismatched host identity issue zero cancel commands; inspection alone never mints a control right.'], 'detached P2 plus test/workbench-detached-control-live.test.ts promoted from manually seeded projection to registered launch/inspect/control','V5','W13-Gw/VC-7 owned control',('wb-79k.3','wb-0kg.3'),conditions='No blanket auto-grant: host permissions must derive from existing host authority, never model input. Extends the script path only; optional MNI P11 remains separate.',prior=('EAT-R296',))
